## 4. Alert Types

### A. Availability

| AlertType | 조건 | Severity |
|-----------|------|----------|
| SERVER_UNREACHABLE | lifecycle_state == UNREACHABLE 또는 OrchestrationResult.status == FAILED | CRITICAL |

### B. Hardware Health

| AlertType | 조건 | Severity |
|-----------|------|----------|
| PSU_FAILURE | health.psu != OK | CRITICAL (if Critical) / WARNING (if Warning) |
| THERMAL_ANOMALY | health.thermal != OK | CRITICAL / WARNING |
| STORAGE_WARNING | health.storage != OK | CRITICAL / WARNING |
| FAN_FAILURE | health.fan != OK | CRITICAL / WARNING |
| CPU_DEGRADATION | health.cpu != OK | CRITICAL / WARNING |
| MEMORY_DEGRADATION | health.memory != OK | CRITICAL / WARNING |
| NETWORK_DEGRADATION | health.network != OK | CRITICAL / WARNING |
| SYSTEM_HEALTH_DEGRADATION | health.system != OK | CRITICAL / WARNING |

### C. Verification

| AlertType | 조건 | Severity |
|-----------|------|----------|
| HARDWARE_DISCREPANCY | VerificationResult.discrepancy_count > 0 | WARNING |

### D. Inventory Change

| AlertType | 조건 | Severity |
|-----------|------|----------|
| HARDWARE_CHANGE | CPU/Memory/Storage/Network/GPU 변경 감지 | WARNING |
| OS_CHANGE | OS distribution/kernel/hostname 변경 | WARNING |
| OS_REINSTALL | 동일 hardware_identity + OS 변경 | INFO |

### E. Compute

| AlertType | 조건 | Severity |
|-----------|------|----------|
| COMPUTE_ELIGIBILITY_CHANGE | eligibility canonical 값 변경 | INFO (개선) / WARNING (악화) |

### F. Recovery

| AlertType | 조건 | Severity |
|-----------|------|----------|
| HEALTH_RECOVERED | 이전 health != OK → 현재 health == OK | INFO |

