## 6. Severity

### Severity 매핑

```python
def _health_to_severity(health: HealthStatus) -> AlertSeverity:
    if health == HealthStatus.CRITICAL:
        return AlertSeverity.CRITICAL
    elif health == HealthStatus.WARNING:
        return AlertSeverity.WARNING
    elif health == HealthStatus.UNKNOWN:
        return AlertSeverity.WARNING  # UNKNOWN은 WARNING으로 취급
    return AlertSeverity.INFO
```

### Severity Escalation

- Warning → Critical: 기존 Alert의 severity를 CRITICAL으로 upgrade (같은 AlertRecord)
- Critical → Warning: severity를 WARNING으로 downgrade (같은 AlertRecord)
- Critical/Warning → OK: Alert를 RESOLVED로 변경 + HEALTH_RECOVERED 이벤트

