## 7. Fingerprint / Deduplication

### Fingerprint 구성

```
fingerprint = sha256(
    server_id + ":" + alert_type + ":" + field_path
)
```

예시:
```
fingerprint = sha256("R750-001:PSU_FAILURE:health.psu")
fingerprint = sha256("R750-001:HARDWARE_DISCREPANCY:cpu.total_cores")
fingerprint = sha256("R750-001:OS_CHANGE:os.distribution")
```

### Deduplication Logic

```python
def process_alert(new_alert_candidate):
    # 1. fingerprint로 기존 OPEN alert 검색
    existing = store.find_open_alert(fingerprint)

    if existing is None:
        # 2a. 새 Alert 생성
        create_alert(new_alert_candidate)
        create_event(CREATED)

    elif existing.status == AlertStatus.OPEN:
        # 2b. 기존 Alert 갱신
        if new_severity > existing.severity:
            # escalation
            update_alert(existing, severity=new_severity)
            create_event(ESCALATED)
        elif new_severity < existing.severity:
            # de-escalation
            update_alert(existing, severity=new_severity)
            create_event(UPDATED)
        else:
            # 동일 condition, last_seen_at만 갱신
            update_alert(existing, last_seen_at=now)
            # event 생성하지 않음 (duplicate suppression)

    elif existing.status == AlertStatus.RESOLVED:
        # 2c. Re-open
        update_alert(existing, status=OPEN)
        create_event(REOPENED)
```

### Q5 답변: Warning → Critical escalation

같은 Alert로 처리한다. 같은 fingerprint를 가지며, severity만 upgrade된다.
AlertEvent에 ESCALATED 이벤트가 기록된다.

