## 8. Lifecycle

### Alert Lifecycle States

```
                    ┌──────────┐
         create     │   OPEN   │
              ─────→│          │
                    └────┬─────┘
                         │
              ┌──────────┼──────────┐
              │          │          │
              ▼          ▼          ▼
     ┌────────────┐ ┌────────┐ ┌───────────┐
     │ACKNOWLEDGED│ │ESCALATE│ │  RESOLVED  │
     │            │ │(same   │ │ (recovery)│
     └─────┬──────┘ │ alert) │ └─────┬─────┘
           │        └────────┘       │
           │                         │
           └────────┬────────────────┘
                    │
                    ▼
              ┌──────────┐
              │ REOPENED  │
              │ (→ OPEN)  │
              └──────────┘
```

### Lifecycle Transitions

| From | To | Trigger | Event Type |
|------|-----|---------|------------|
| (none) | OPEN | Alert condition detected | CREATED |
| OPEN | ACKNOWLEDGED | User/manual acknowledge | ACKNOWLEDGED |
| OPEN | OPEN (escalated) | Severity increased | ESCALATED |
| OPEN | RESOLVED | Condition recovered | RESOLVED |
| ACKNOWLEDGED | RESOLVED | Condition recovered | RESOLVED |
| RESOLVED | OPEN | Condition re-occurred | REOPENED |

